    {
      "id": "moor_ferrin_wear_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“No roof since my father's time.” Ferrin does not look up from the fire. “And eight worn places in the flags in front of it, even as fence posts.” Now the look up. “Worn through. Grit does not wear through in a century unless somebody is standing on it, and there has not been a shoot off that house since before the roof went.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "moor_shoot_wear"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_ferrin_wear_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_ferrin_wear_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_library",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_ferrin_wear_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_ferrin_line_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“They did not want it and I did.” He unrolls a corner of it without being asked, which tells you how often he looks at it. “Drives, butts, beaters' lines, the whole moor.” A finger on one line. “That one does not stop at the scarp. It is drawn over and down, and it is the same ink as the rest, which means whoever drew it drew it on the same afternoon and thought nothing of it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "moor_shoot_line"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_ferrin_line_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
