    {
      "id": "moor_ferrin_map_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He rolls it properly before he hands it over, which takes a while and is the whole of what he thinks about it. “Eight in the line,” Ferrin says. “Seven of them you can walk to. The eighth is drawn where there is no ground.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
